":"https://insights.techmahindra.com/investors/agm-transcript-28.07.2020.pdf","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2026","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/758bed2c-792d-434f-a326-118a8b4e7989.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2025","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/b4a4a9f6-cfbe-4c32-a691-1b4f08e81308.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/a0b3b3ad-6137-48e4-8df8-7c3fa9303540.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/80910fd6-6181-45f3-945b-5cb743f26965.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://insights.techmahindra.com/investors/tml-integrated-annual-report-fy-2021-22-f.pdf","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/73354532755.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/68770532755.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/5327550320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/5327550319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/5327550318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/5327550317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/5327550316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/5327550315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532755/5327550314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_1542_TECHM_2012_2013_10092013151040.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Tech Mahindra reported a strong Q2 FY27 performance with revenue of $1.693 billion, marking 7.2% year-on-year growth in constant currency, supported by broad-based growth and large deal ramp-ups. Operating margins stood at 14.8%, and management reiterated its commitment to achieving the full-year FY27 EBIT margin target of 15%. Total deal wins for the quarter were $1.023 billion, and the Board of Directors recommended a 1:1 bonus share issue and declared an interim dividend of INR 15 per share. Management highlighted the scale-up of TechM Helix, its AI initiative, and expanding enterprise-grade AI engagements across multiple industries.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company remains on track to achieve its full-year FY27 EBIT margin target of 15%.","quote":"We reiterate that we remain on track to achieve our full-year FY27 EBIT margin target of 15%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company reiterates its stance to maintain 90% to 100% free cash flow to PAT on a full-year basis.","quote":"We reiterate our stance to maintain 90% to 100% free cash flow to PAT on a full-year basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects normal seasonality without unreasonable furloughs in Q3 or Q4.","quote":"No, we expect normal seasonality. We continue to see some weaknesses in our European auto manufacturing business, but those are all manageable within the existing portfolio that we have. So we do not expect unreasonable seasonality or unreasonable furloughs in Q3 or Q4.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company established the Toronto Innovation Hub to foster client co-creation and AI innovation.","quote":"We established the Toronto Innovation Hub to bring together client co-creation and AI innovation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Operating margins for the quarter stood at 14.8%, driven by strong volume growth and Project Fortius savings, though partially offset by wage hikes.","quote":"EBIT for the quarter stood at US$250 million with an EBIT margin of 14.8%, up 40 basis points on a Q-o-Q basis and 260 basis points on a Y-o-Y basis. The margin improvement was driven by strong volume growth and Project Fortius savings, partially offset by the wage hikes.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The Board of Directors recommended a bonus share issue in a ratio of 1:1 for shareholders.","quote":"As we mark this milestone, I'm also pleased to announce that our Board of Directors has recommended a bonus share issue in a ratio of 1:1 for our shareholders.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"},{"claim":"The board declared an interim dividend of INR 15 per share.","quote":"The board has declared an interim dividend of INR15 per share, reaffirming our commitment to the laid-out capital allocation policy of returning 85% and above of free cash flow back to shareholders.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"A sequential revenue headwind associated with the large European automotive program is expected in Q3 to a much smaller extent.","quote":"A sequential revenue headwind associated with the program is expected in Q3 as well, though to a much smaller extent.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company expects to introduce AI revenue reporting as part of its H2 FY27 disclosures.","quote":"We expect to introduce AI revenue reporting as part of our H2 FY27 disclosures and continue it on an ongoing basis, refining the methodology as our portfolio and the markets mature.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf","timeframe":"H2 FY27"},{"claim":"The company aims to train 200 engineers in the next quarter on deep techniques to hone models and harnesses.","quote":"We have curated a special internal course to ensure 200 engineers get trained in the next quarter on some deep techniques to hone models and harnesses.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73a1ce37-8a16-4011-b2d6-cc4f3165de5f.pdf","timeframe":"next quarter"}],"coverage":{"docs